# Git Ignore Configuration for Unreal Engine 5 Projects
# ----------------------------------------------------

# Folders to completely ignore
# These folders contain temporary, generated, or cache files
Binaries/
Build/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/

# Ignore Engine folders inside the project (e.g. plugins downloaded)
Engine/

# Standard OS generated files
.DS_Store
.vscode/

# Ignore files in the root directory
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.suo

# Ignore Visual Studio related files
.vs/
*.sln
*.vcxproj
*.vcxproj.user

# Mac ignores
# Mac ignores are generally located in the .DS_Store section but sometimes needed here too
*.xcworkspace
*.xcodeproj

# Additional files that should not be tracked by Git
# If you are using C++ you will not want to track these:
# Source/ThirdParty/
# Plugins/PluginName/Source/ThirdParty/

# NOTE on Content/ Folder:
# Content/ folder is generally tracked, but its files (.uasset, .umap) are handled by Git LFS 
# via the .gitattributes file. Do NOT ignore the Content/ folder entirely here.